{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"c05701274b0544c8e63a810c5e040b032526008d669989079eb1674983d04821","ja":"そこには山があった……","zh":"那里有一座山……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ab99b8518e9739fa0584e4073c53e1aee16fecf9c12bd91b5342168fdd3916cd","ja":"「お待たせいたしました。\nそれでは、チャレンジ料理、オープン！」","zh":"「让大家久等了。\n那么，挑战料理，揭晓！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"7b18d653d8d5c3d131f59667c9d4b87f585622ce4d772d17eade1509069cbbc4","ja":"えっ……、ええ～～～～っ！？","zh":"诶……，诶诶～～～～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1f809f1f14233970dad33db669f4c483f87a136d200ca490707083a2b2974db0","ja":"こ、この山みたいなの、\nもしかして、パスタですか～！？","zh":"这、这个像小山一样的东西，\n难道是意面吗～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"8b314c3fffdabeef63428fb5c7347c9a2a4eaeea3d133d235c083b7b318b720d","ja":"上に乗ってるゴツゴツしたのは溶岩じゃなくて、お肉\nたっぷりのミートソース……文字通り、山盛りの……！","zh":"上面凹凸不平的不是熔岩，而是肉末\n超多的肉酱……名副其实堆积如山……！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"48f71795b5be47a12050fc1ddfa9ee4ca18bea3ee1fec5a84083363d1993d5f0","ja":"「それでは、さっそく始めていただきましょう！\nよーい……スタート！」","zh":"“那么，就请立刻开始吧！\n各就各位……开始！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f3f83e810f0f0440acdf229e112ebefa79c879968724dac2dcc5f345eaf12a51","ja":"と、とにかく食べよう！\n見てても量は減らないから！","zh":"总、总之先吃吧！\n光看着份量也不会变少的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a49c8077cd76da884523a8294efaf315cf8c680930fa6196e6609b51874b9888","ja":"そうだね！\nみんなで協力してこの山を登り切ろっ！","zh":"说得对！\n大家一起齐心协力登上这座山吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"0b8f5a24c325a1730425f969a999803a1f34cc8f40298421e8499f37fa22233e","ja":"い、いただきます！\n……ぱくっ！　もぐもぐ……。","zh":"我、我开动了！\n……啊呜！嚼嚼……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"a003db6cef32d52f1eedfb66574278e86625c9b2ba010c8da4f9e68971cdd8d6","ja":"んんーっ！\nこのパスタ、すっごくおいし～い！","zh":"嗯嗯——！\n这盘意面，超级好吃～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"5c2f977f0dc1c90534e1ddd015aa335993462cd5e81c027d2478ae0412d82382","ja":"このミートソースの隠し味、なんだろう……。\nうーん、食べたことありそうなんだけどなあ……。","zh":"这份肉酱的隐藏风味是什么呢……\n唔——感觉好像在哪里吃过啊……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"8042e73f7459e77f07a288919b33ba5ae6522d8c924668ed0d055a7c285a448e","ja":"ミナコ～、ゆっくり味わいたい気持ちも\nわかるけど、早く食べないと間に合わないヨ！","zh":"美奈子～，我也能理解你想要慢慢品尝的\n心情，但不快点吃的话会赶不上哟！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"1349fc4ff96b9730152e7ea3028d5dee419e6dc52748e81310001f8b5d08379a","ja":"開始から20分後……","zh":"开始20分钟后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"f361a9cc3c58ad7c0e4656dc9df0c9d58d0cea65b39d8efc6348953fcdbdea80","ja":"うう……すっごくおいしいけど、\nずっと食べてると、飽きてきちゃうね……。","zh":"呜呜……虽然超级好吃，\n但一直吃的话，就会有点腻呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"81c43677c292d16a837c45d26febec0fa9da56edc08588ad546d5bf9bad6a947","ja":"そういう時は、パスタ、ソース、チーズのバランスで\n味を変化させながら食べるといいみたいだよ!","zh":"遇到这种情况时，调整意面、酱汁和芝士的搭配比例，\n一边变换风味一边吃似乎是个不错的办法哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"c59e695f9d75ae9d9ed8ce022aae1c1c77579afc28f278bf7862053d1362b620","ja":"調味料はおかわり自由だから、\n味変するのもアリかもですっ！","zh":"调料可以无限续加，\n换换口味或许也不错哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"199f32a89c5a9af12cd8c7b0dd65ee6199c86e17f53b5b7fa7477573e0bfc1b7","ja":"開始から30分後……","zh":"开始30分钟后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"fdf5c59259f5e81524882b72f4c24604b74cc9d97ea04a2afb2450d86bfc9202","ja":"「ついにミートソースパスタが残り2割を切った！\nアイドル5人、大健闘を見せています！」","zh":"「肉酱意面终于只剩下不到2成！\n5位偶像展现出了顽强的拼搏之姿！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"b591818f8f2fc6c845579b4e4486db52dd156799a6fc367ab0b99582dd38a9a1","ja":"みんな、あともう少しだよ、頑張ろう！","zh":"大家，就差一点点了，加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"f4541a4c39983da5e4c379ba605df19a22af030d662ddd3969ae29e57a20a49b","ja":"うん！　そろそろこのパスタの山も\n崩せそう……って……｡","zh":"嗯！这座意大利面山好像也差不多\n能解决掉了……等等……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1458.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"d9e3ac7d3438f4657973002854d8d305d6cbcbb70137f706aa0138721e28888c","ja":"ええ～～～っ！？","zh":"诶诶～～～！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
